msgctxt "164"
msgid "You ready to get moving, Kiryu?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Kiryu! What took you so long?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Sorry, Date-san. I got here as fast as I could."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"Don't worry about it. Gotta say, though. Tamiya ringing you up is a pretty "
"unexpected development."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "Yeah... Hopefully meeting him will clear some things up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"Hope so. And don't forget that Tamiya's one of the biggest political "
"figureheads in the country. Who knows what he could be planning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"In other words, we should be ready for anything. You about\r\n"
"good to go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "Not quite yet. There are still a few things I need to take care of."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "All right, just don't take too long! I'm not getting any younger here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
